hire_description:
A residential complex in the Cultural District of Saadiyat Island needs a sustainability review to ensure it meets Estidama's energy reduction standards. The goal is to achieve at least a 37% energy reduction through the Estidama 1 Pearl Rating.

Tasks:
* Review the complex's existing systems and identify areas for improvement;
* Analyze the building's energy consumption patterns;
Deliverable: report detailing improvements needed to meet sustainability standards. Engagement duration: 3-4 months.
